  "all_ingredients_flat": "sprouted mung beans, asafoetida (hing), onion, tomato, capsicum, carrot, peanut milk residue, roasted cumin powder, freshly crushed black pepper, mango powder (amchoor), flaxseed powder",
  "instructions": "BATTER: Grind sprouted mung beans & a pinch of asafoetida (hing), without adding any water.\nCOOK: Spread batter on non-stick pan with toppings like onion, tomato, capsicum & carrot (everything diced & shredded), along with some peanut milk residue. Cover with a lid. Cook for 5 mins at low to medium flame.\nGARNISH: Sprinkle some roasted cumin powder, freshly crushed black pepper, mango powder (amchoor) & flaxseed powder.\nSERVE: Fold the Cheela. Serve with chutneys of our choice \u2014 Tomato Chutney or Mint-Cilantro Chutney or Amla-Date Chutney.",
  "cooking_methods": [
    "blend",
    "cook",
    "no-cook"
  ],
  "serving_suggestion": "Fold the Cheela. Serve with chutneys of our choice \u2014 Tomato Chutney or Mint-Cilantro Chutney or Amla-Date Chutney.",
